Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.25,0:01:46.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(812.8,700.8)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Drowning in Red!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.25,0:01:46.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806,767)\fnPapyrus\fs60}A 36th Birthday Celebration!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.05,0:01:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to buy\Nanother Oinkie Draw ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.88,0:01:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a sweet surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wisdom number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.42,0:01:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of just one person crafting a way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with two sets of hands\Nthere'll be much more pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that, good sir, is\Nthe made way I choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.44,0:02:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, paste away, paste away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, wisdom number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, maybe we should stop, Chief. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because this song's a total downer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, paste away, paste away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's still singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.48,0:02:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Chief, how many\Nmore do we have to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.10,0:02:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each one is a half of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, like a million? A million?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.34,0:02:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With five of us, it's\Nonly $200,000 per person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want to give up on\Nthe cafe, do you, Nagomi, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.86,0:02:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to do these now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't pay the half a million in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.72,0:02:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,interest within the month\Nfor our overdue dues,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they said we have to close shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.17,0:02:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.09,0:02:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clock's already ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're out of ideas, our only chance\Nis to move our fingers at lightning speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.60,0:02:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a million more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make these flowers with all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.60,0:02:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The towel has already been rolled!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you mean dice, not towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Nogomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are those new flyers you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:03:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look a little different\Nfrom the flyers you had before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, we can't afford to buy ink,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.66,0:03:07.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499,194)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Some cute little pigs live in this brick
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.66,0:03:07.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,270)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}house we call Oinky Doink Café.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.66,0:03:07.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(442,346)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}In order to become the finest Iberico pork,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.66,0:03:07.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(557,421)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}our little piggies eagerly await
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.66,0:03:07.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,497)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}all you masters and mistresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we're printing them as light\Nas possible to get by for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's original.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.88,0:03:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What sort of things can we do\Nto bring in money to our cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think special events\Nare always effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of events?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.82,0:03:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have Cosmo Mellow's stay tomorrow,\Nand next week it's Kafka Big Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having fun events really\Nhelps to bring customers in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.36,0:03:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that actually sounds like a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great idea is the birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A birthday? If I recall,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your cafe is part of\Nthe Creatureland group,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you might be able to ask\Nanother affiliated cafe for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dream big go-go!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.87,0:03:48.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(425.6,764.8)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A birthday party? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anyone have a\Nbirthday coming up soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Count me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to know\Nwhen my birthday is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, anyone really gets born\Naround this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:04:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I turn 36 in two\Ndays. Wow. In two days?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.00,0:04:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have your 36th\Nbirthday coming up, Bronco?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no cash!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your pig brains instead of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got that, Ronko? Got it. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help out as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.27,0:04:15.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(246.4,571.2)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, have some grub. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This crappy slap again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.06,0:04:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be glad it has flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Siobhan, back during\Nthe war, they boiled...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the two newbies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're planning Ronko's birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think they'll be ready in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it helps, I came up with\Nan idea for a flyer. Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I take a look?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,259)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}Ranko Mannen's Birthday Celebration
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(576,335)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}In what we realize are busy times,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,410)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}we nonetheless invite you to find the time
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(634,486)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}and join us for this occasion.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,562)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}Doors open May 9th at 18:00
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.76,0:04:38.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(749,637)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I realize the fact that it lacks impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it has plenty of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also considered some\Npotential activities.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(499,43)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}•Coin magic •Animal impressions •Solo shiritori
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422,119)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}•Voice-delay ventriloquism •Card magic •American duck
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(365,194)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}impression •Drink juice from a cup with no hands •Impressions
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(346,270)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}•Juggling •Groveling hot towel •Tablecloth pull •Air chair squat
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(403,346)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}•Humiliating belly dance •Magic tricks •Regurgitation trick
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(326,421)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}•The Human Dance •Loach Scooping Dance •Nankin-tamasudare
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(346,497)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}•Hanafuda fishing •Hanafuda roppyakken •Hanafuda oichokabu
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,572)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}•Sic bo •Cho-han •Chinchirorin •Choboichi
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(557,648)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}•Tehonbiki •Tabu •A skit •Bonodori dance
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.97,0:04:48.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(883,724)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41\c&H0000FF&}PRIZES?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly sure where\Nto insert a coin toss game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.36,0:04:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cointess?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's way too early for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, maybe one day I might be\Nintrigued, but considering my age...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think age matters\Nwhen playing coin toss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.26,0:05:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.28,0:05:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we can't do everything\Nwritten on that list!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really don't think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then, let's take a look\Nand try to consolidate it a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, if it might be feasible,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.08,0:05:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could we get Ronko a birthday\Ncake or something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cheap one would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.29,0:05:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're living off stir-fried bean sprouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think we have the\Ncash for a stupid cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if Ronko's birthday\Nparty ends up being popular?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being popular?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ends up being popular?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is gonna come\Ncelebrate Ronko's birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't cause any problems\Nwith any of our regulars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.81,0:05:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the top earner here at Oinky Doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking after my masters is\Nwhat keeps this place going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, of course it is, Lady Yumechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Irrelevant maid birthdays should be done\Nquietly off in the corner somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.82,0:06:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Irrelevant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Yumechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, Thunderling!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two can go off and have\Nyour own party if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep making flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told her off good, huh, Lady Yumechi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, hog heads, time to feed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.38,0:06:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could they say that?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.04,0:06:34.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(528,988.8)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.21,0:06:40.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(112,350.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Happy Birthday
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.46,0:06:41.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1356.8,264)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Birthday Celebration
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you not sleep, Nagomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stop thinking about tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you been working all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured I should at least get\Nall of the decorations put up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.42,0:06:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I help at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate it, but\NI'm just about finished here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay then.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.16,0:07:11.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(872,52.8)\frz348.9\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Birthday Celebration
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.16,0:07:11.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(985,158.8)\frz347.5\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Reservations
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do to help\Nget some reservations?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you might be able to ask\Nanother affiliated cafe for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dream Big Go Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.22,0:07:26.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(865.6,265.6)\fnPapyrus\fs41}Maid Sheep
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.68,0:07:29.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(828.4,234.6)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Maid Sheep
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, okay, let's go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wooly fluff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, mistresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How may I serve you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're actually from a sister-maid cafe\Ncalled the Oinky Doink Cafe. Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A comrade of ours! Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have an event at 6 o 'clock,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we were hoping to hand out\Nsome flyers, if that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Karuko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's fine. Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:07:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, we're a little\Nshort-staffed right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, it would be nice if\Nyou could help us out for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Ronco?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.20,0:08:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my talents will suffice. Suffice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so mature!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so lively in here. Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be great if\Neven a small percentage
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of these masters stopped\Nby on their way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.84,0:08:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here visiting from Oinky Doink Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.40,0:08:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please take a flyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.66,0:08:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're having a birthday party?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko here is celebrating\Nher birthday today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're having a party at 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be great if you could stop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Is something wrong? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the exact same birthday. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.44,0:08:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today just so happens to be\Nmy birthday party as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.76,0:08:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I have the same birthday\Nas such a lovely fellow maid like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy fluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karuko, happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I didn't realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm, uh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How old are you today, Runco?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.00,0:09:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be turning 36.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.80,0:09:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be turning 36?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rat, ox, tiger?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, 15 years older than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have so much experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yikes, is she really a 36-year-old maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about ripe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, did that make you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.86,0:09:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that age has nothing\Nto do with being a cute maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear a word you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.28,0:09:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here, Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my, leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you want to hand\Nout your party flyers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.90,0:09:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These tiny black and white\Nflyers with super faint ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have originality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very muted originality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.40,0:09:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's a wonderful\Nflyer that shows how
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,passionate Ronco is\Nabout her birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should take our leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault. It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really appreciated it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.34,0:10:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For standing up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.68,0:10:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was really worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.50,0:10:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you were going to get mad at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and go on one of your rampages.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get angry for my own sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.47,0:10:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I ever get slightly emotional at all,\Nit's only because someone insults the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can say that I'm\Ndevoted to the oinky-doink just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other cafes are so unfriendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And honestly, I don't want to\Nbe a part of all this violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that maids have\Nto fight, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With turf wars intensifying now,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.80,0:10:53.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(768,302)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Maid Teahouse
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's realistic to\Nstick with a zero-violence policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko, if you intend on\Nliving your life as a maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:11:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will need to be prepared\Nto take up arms at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you don't like all\Nthe violence, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine to think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's one lesson I've learned,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's what you can stand to lose\Nif you don't stand and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.76,0:11:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What business do you have with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.36,0:11:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Filthy pics I made!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.56,0:11:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can get cocky with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.02,0:11:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought fighting within the\Nsame group violates our code.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you just really pissed me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you come with us\Nfor just a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll leave left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.66,0:12:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Miss Ronko!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of all this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.66,0:12:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just had to have the same\Nbirthday as me, silly pig. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, here in Akiba, we don't\Nneed more than one birthday on the same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone was so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other maids who had the same birthday,\Nwell, let's just say they all popped?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.82,0:12:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and disappeared like pretty red bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.26,0:12:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that you killed them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy fluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:13:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost time for it to\Nbegin, isn't it? Huh? Your party?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.90,0:13:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it starts at six o 'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.77,0:13:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll host your big\Nbirthday party right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a special birthday present
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, your birthday and the day\Nthat you die are going to match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, my birthday's on April 2nd!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lovely, and your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.42,0:13:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means my birthday won't\Nmatch the day that I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.23,0:13:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.80,0:13:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dream of cute little sheep frolicking\Nin the night and sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.72,0:13:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.27,0:13:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kigomi, try to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.14,0:13:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.38,0:13:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just tomato juice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.82,0:13:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about that is actually good?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.49,0:14:05.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(847.6,565.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Happy Birthday
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.49,0:14:05.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(913.2,612.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ranko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.16,0:14:10.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(922,292)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}DORAMA
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I put my heart and soul into baking this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining like holy light!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the size of that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really bake this and decorate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give her a proper celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.14,0:14:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we managed to buy a cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we lived off of nothing\Nbut bean sprouts, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For better or for worse, there\Nare still no masters here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's hide this cake fast\Nand go get ready for the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm sure we all thought we were\Nbusted with Yumechi's crabby acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's hard trying to\Nact like you're mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.00,0:14:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're gonna have to do our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to nail Ronco's birthday surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Zoya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.78,0:14:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, piggy pranksters,\Nlet's pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.22,0:14:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco, do you think we're\Ngoing to die in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Ronco, I always wanted\Nto live my life as a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I was worried that I\Nwouldn't have what it takes to be one,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still got hired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.74,0:15:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me, where do you think\Nit was that I went wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,36 years ago today, if I hadn't been\Nborn, we wouldn't be here. Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's an important day for\Nus to celebrate you being born!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it isn't right for you to\Nput yourself down like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve such kind words.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Nogome, I was rolling\Nin the joint up until last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.62,0:15:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the only thing to look\Nforward to was a single donut
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.66,0:15:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in Cafe Au Lait that was\Ngiven to me for my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rolling in the joint? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.42,0:15:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I was looking forward\Nto my birthday this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, joint!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.98,0:16:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind of joint!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well then, I respect\Nyou for the time you served.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, this is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, on the contrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude\Nbecause planning my birthday
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,party with you was a\Nvery happy time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Circumstances brought me to the cafe,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I am grateful that I got to\Njoin Oinky Doink as a cute maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.18,0:16:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The others should be out\Nsearching for us very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll never find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Ronko Manon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.36,0:16:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the heck are those hog heads?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.06,0:16:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're wasting our time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea of being\Nlate to their own party?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they never come back here,\Nthat'll be way too funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:17:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Ronko's cake will be for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.82,0:17:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course that wouldn't dare\Nhappen. Yeah, like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way I'd let that fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.08,0:17:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you see Nogomi and Ronko? Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,259)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ranko Mannen's Birthday Celebration
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1018,464)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Maid Café & Bar
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1056,540)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Maid Sheep
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(730,616)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Masters and Mistresses, why not come to Maid Sheep
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(845,691)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}for a soothing woolly fluffy time with us?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(634,767)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Our cute little lambs will delight you with impressive performances
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(826,842)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}and tons of delicious food made with love!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.08,0:17:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we need to buy more ink.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.27,0:17:25.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(939.2,86.4)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Maid Sheep
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.22,0:17:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lily Flop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogomi, hold your mouth up higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.76,0:17:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll drink it all down. For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco, I have to confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:17:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lied earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm glad I got to be a maid\Nthat I got to doink-oink-y-doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.14,0:18:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogami! Nogami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.82,0:18:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Cowrako, we apparently broke\Na revenue record today. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my birthday party after all. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.42,0:18:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.10,0:18:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're affiliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like we care!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a surprise birthday\Nparty at stake here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.24,0:18:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Lamb Chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.20,0:18:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have the money to buy ink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring us Rocco and\NNagomi right now, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.82,0:18:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want our cake to go to waste?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.72,0:18:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid smelly porkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you want to\Nbe turned into bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can it, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.82,0:18:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pissed and super hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let our days of eating\Nbeansprouts be for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.64,0:18:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding all you mutton accountable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll show you exactly what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.22,0:18:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you take us paper-wagly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.52,0:19:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.14,0:19:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to play with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, you're super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.24,0:19:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogomi! Nogomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.84,0:19:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get you out of here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cost us a major hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here now
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.10,0:19:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.82,0:19:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi are you all right? Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So like what are we\Ngonna do with this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.94,0:19:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell should I care\Nabout this crappy place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should have known\Nthey had it coming to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You worthless sowas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way the Creatureland\Ngroup will let this slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.34,0:20:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end of your cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.52,0:20:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die in the gutter, filthy pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wooly bitches kidnapped the\Ntwo of them in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.50,0:20:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between me and that maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of us do you think offers\Nmore value to the Creatureland group?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that shabby old\Nbag doesn't cut it as a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.20,0:20:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a joke to the profession.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the one the group\Nneeds in their flock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that shitty maid who can't\Nhope to bring in customers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.78,0:20:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that for shabby?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.62,0:20:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no shitty\Nmaids. Not in our cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid missing out on her own\Nparty that's unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.58,0:20:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.60,0:21:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I should be the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.16,0:21:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to apologize,\Nsay it to the chief first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.00,0:21:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She ended up managing the\Nwhole thing by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two go inside first. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are the lights off?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, dear Rongo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.40,0:21:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy 36th birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, piglets!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.18,0:21:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying? To go me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cake is smaller. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.84,0:21:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, dipshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.36,0:21:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've ended up ate it.
